WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.471
Trivia Trap is a quick-fire quiz where wrong answers cost you. One to ten players, so you can try it alone.

2
00:00:08.171 --> 00:00:16.044
Each question gives you fifteen seconds. Get it right and you earn a hundred points, plus up to a hundred more for being fast.

3
00:00:16.194 --> 00:00:19.307
Get it wrong, or run out of time, and you lose a heart.

4
00:00:20.007 --> 00:00:28.539
Every fourth round is a trap door round. You pick a door, one, two, or three, and one of them is rigged. Whoever picks it loses a heart.

5
00:00:28.689 --> 00:00:32.925
Run out of hearts and you're out. The survivor with the most points wins.
